# Environment / secrets (Release Gate 0)
# Every env file is ignored (.env, .env.local, .env.staging, .env.production,
# .env.development, .env.test, .env.k6, .env.*.local, ...). Real staging and
# production credentials belong OUTSIDE the repository; see
# docs/RELEASE-GATE-0-SECURITY-REVIEW.md.
.env
.env.*
.env*.local
# The template is committed on purpose (placeholders only, never real values).
!.env.example
